WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.429 --> 00:00:07.459
Hey, I got a funny voicemail at two one nine
two David P. about my pronunciation of a city

00:00:07.459 --> 00:00:08.459
in Oklahoma.

00:00:08.459 --> 00:00:09.459
Take a listen.

00:00:09.459 --> 00:00:12.950
Hey, thank you for listening to this.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.410
I'm a listener and I love your show.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:24.060
I just want to let you know that I watched
the episode where Trump was at Mount Rushmore

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.280
and said lots of things incorrectly.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:30.370
And when you announced that he was at Tulsa,
Oklahoma, you said Tulsa.

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.850
So you might want to go back and correct that.

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:34.850
Yeah.

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:38.720
So nobody catches it and says anything bad
about you.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:39.720
Absolutely.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:40.720
Delightful voicemail.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:41.720
People will say bad things about me.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.900
Either way, it's just an inside joke.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.840
Going back to the Tulsi Gabbard.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.340
Tulsi days.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.420
I'm just mispronouncing it in the same.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.320
It's just it's a dumb inside joke.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:53.410
And I apologize if anybody was upset by it.

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:56.180
But, you know, I know that it's pronounced
Tulsa, Oklahoma.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:01:00.630
But just to get us back to the days of the
Democratic primary, I've been having a good

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:02.050
time calling it Tulsa.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:03.260
But I know that it's Tulsa.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:04.940
I appreciate it anyway.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:05.940
OK.

